  src/main/java/io/github/hecbatista/metalshaders/glsl/ProgramTranslator.java translates a
  vertex and fragment stage together, as one program: one uniform block holding the union of
  both stages' uniforms in a fixed order, and one shared table of in/out locations by name,
  with a matrix taking one location per column. This design is described in Vitrail's
  docs/translation.md ("The unit of translation is the program, not the file"). No Vitrail
  code was read or copied for it.

